  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HollowCurrent.Interactable
  Kind: 1
  Label: Arrival note
  Body: '14 BELLWETHER LANE


    The Harrows left in a hurry. They reported footsteps
    above an empty dining room and a child''s toy playing below the furnace.


    Scout
    the wardrobe, linen cupboard and basement locker. She can follow you back to
    the van. Never hide while it is watching you.'
